  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Patel",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:57:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:57:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, morning. I'm calling about a streetlight that's out in front of my place. It's been dark since before the holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:57:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, got it. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:57:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "126 Bridge Street, down in the Point. Oh, and by the way, is this the right department for that, or do I need the electric company?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:57:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nope, you're right, we take those. Streetlight out at 126 Bridge Street, since before the holidays. Is it the whole light that's out, or does it flicker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:57:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Totally out. Doesn't flicker, just dead. Oh, I'm also rewatching an old sitcom for the fifth time, so I notice it's dark every night when I take the trash out. Anyway, the light. Can you send a crew to check the pole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:57:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I'll put in a request for a crew to look at the pole. Is there a number on it, a little tag or sticker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:57:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] I didn't look. I can go check, hang on... actually it's too high to read from here. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:57:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, the address will do. Best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:57:59-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0193."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:58:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0193, got it. You're all set, David. They'll get to it as they can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T08:58:05-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thanks."
    }
  ],
